      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……跑完『日本杯』之后\n我可以参加『有马纪念』吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "92ab230da65f97f7e701bcce89f9e1a6dca690ac99ac3037ed23ab739ef76258",
