      "uid": "zhcn:8ba9a7c7e9ffabb52b60fc3d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她本来就是资质优秀的孩子。\n只要一直调整下去，无论精神状态如何\n或许都能找回从前的状态。",
      "source_fingerprint": "92f10339e49305ad8ca9e53bbb5df40209555ea222fd021b1628f8cc16e64e7c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143118.json",
      "json_path": [
